{"body":{"text":["The elevation lifts what was said so that all of it can be looked upon and only what matters seen, to steer by. It lets anyone, a session as much as the author, understand what happened in a session without reading it whole, and grounds Knowledge in what was said rather than in quotes (23/58, 23/64, 24/5). It is the middle of three levels: the sessions beneath, its ground, and Knowledge's briefs above (23/94). It gives what, leaving the why to them, as the session put it (23/93)."]},"id":"1M89XJ4617WH001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A **statement** is one sentence under the rule saying what it conveys, a second allowed only for its reason (23/132). A task is named as the doing, and once done the statement says what now holds (23/98, 23/132). Its status is where it stands now: open; proposed, a session's not taken up; leaning, the author's with doubt; settled, his word; or closed, no longer held (23/125, 23/134 to 23/138). The status rests on its grounds, the utterances the statement was drawn from, listed in the order they were said, so what gave a status, or closed it, is found among them (23/134, 24/13, 24/15). Work is marked only on something to do, todo or done (23/132), and a statement's history is its versions. Statements are fickle, so less is more, and what is already there is looked upon before adding (23/62, 23/86)."]},"id":"1M89XJ4617WH002","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A **topic** is a short addressable name (23/116) holding statements and topics, and where it lives in the sessions, its spans, is read from its statements' grounds; both the session's, taken up by the author (23/111, 23/129, 23/131, 23/132). Whether a statement may stand in several topics is open (23/110)."]},"id":"1M89XJ4617WH003","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Both are types of the wiki, statement and topic, their moulds saying in prose what each holds. The elevation is kept in the wiki beside Knowledge, as the topic Elevation, so Knowledge points into it and keeps its traces where the sessions are not mounted; the author leaned so, unsure (24/11). It is asked as anything in the field is: `outline(@wiki:Elevation, 2)` gives its shape, and what is planned is every statement whose work is todo."]},"id":"1M89XJ4617WH004","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The order of work belongs in Knowledge's prose rather than typed data, work that belongs together a brief of its own, which the author was open to trying first (23/100, 23/116). Threads, paths and cycles go once the elevation replaces them; the session let condensations and measures go too and set statistics aside (23/110, 23/111). Linking a done statement to the commit that built it waits until git is in the field (24/15)."]},"id":"1M89XJ4617WH005","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["What stands is a first drawing, and the author does not trust it as done: the work is ontology, breaking the field into pieces, and asks to be thorough (24/13). The twenty-fourth session drew it from every session read whole, and fresh heads read it in three rounds. They found statuses credited to the session's answers rather than the author's words, tentative words read as settled, and terms used before they were given, and each who read three sessions whole found those held more thinly than the rest; all were mended as found, but only those few sessions were checked whole, and none again after the last mending (24/10). The earlier trial in the twenty-third session's scratchpad is left alone (24/7)."]},"id":"1M89XJ4617WH006","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The next session reads the elevation against the sessions and inspects each topic under the rule, writing statements again whole where they fall short, with fresh heads holding whole sessions (24/5, 24/13), until a round changes only words, as the rule has it. Then Knowledge, stale but for Keeping the field and this brief, is rewritten whole upon it (23/152)."]},"id":"1M89XJ4617WH007","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}